  "limitations": [
    "Issue213 remains open. Historical parallel and serial failures were not reproduced by the current matched experiments; cause remains inconclusive.",
    "The native serial Windows contributor command is a supported scheduling policy, not a production lifecycle repair, a parallel stability claim, or removal of existing assertions and deadlines.",
    "Each diagnostic pair used the same instrumented binary; the selected and full pairs used different builds. Passive instrumentation was removed and production bytes restored before canonical validation.",
    "Historical long-root, ambient-Git, Windows symlink privilege and private-directory permission observations are distinct; this policy does not diagnose or repair all of them.",
    "The complete local canonical gate does not replace required hosted CI, CodeQL, code-quality, security or eligible review. Organization-disabled GitHub Actions remains a merge blocker.",
    "Historical Cargo debt remains 12 advisories: 2 high, 1 moderate, 9 low. This is not a clean audit.",
    "Ignored, skipped and filtered cases are not passes. Counts overlap across lanes and must not be added as a unique-test total.",
    "This evidence was added after implementation validation and requires separate source/tree, full-plan, documentation, personal-path, whitespace and committed-secret checks."
